message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "molfp"
version: "0.3.1"
date-released: "2026-10-13"
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/dataprofessor/molfp"
repository-code: "https://github.com/dataprofessor/molfp"
abstract: >-
  Interpretable molecular fingerprints with SHAP-driven chemical explanations.
  A native Python/RDKit library that computes 30 molecular fingerprint types
  and provides built-in tools for interpretation, visualization, collision
  detection, activity cliff analysis, bioactivity profiling, and SHAP-based
  feature explanation.
authors:
